  "description": "<p>Doing a search that uses an invalid field as a condition results in a 500 Server Error, should probably be a 400 Bad Request.</p>\n\n<p>From the Fedora logs</p>\n\n\n<p>INFO 11:57:14.231 [qtp722306493-28] (FedoraSearch) GET on search with conditions: [fedora_id=<b><em>,</em> myField=</b>], and fields: null<br/>\nWARN 11:57:14.232 [qtp722306493-28] (WildcardExceptionMapper) Unmapped exception<br/>\njava.lang.IllegalArgumentException: No enum constant org.fcrepo.search.api.Condition.Field.MYFIELD<br/>\nat java.base/java.lang.Enum.valueOf(Enum.java:240)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.search.api.Condition$Field.valueOf(Condition.java:45)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.search.api.Condition$Field.fromString(Condition.java:59)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.search.api.Condition.fromExpression(Condition.java:127)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraSearch.parse(FedoraSearch.java:160)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraSearch.doSearch(FedoraSearch.java:93)<br/>\nat java.base/jdk.internal.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke0(Native Method)<br/>\nat java.base/jdk.internal.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke(NativeMethodAccessorImpl.java:62)<br/>\nat java.base/jdk.internal.reflect.DelegatingMethodAccessorImpl.invoke(DelegatingMethodAccessorImpl.java:43)<br/>\nat java.base/java.lang.reflect.Method.invoke(Method.java:566)</p>",
